{{!-- "3 new · Show": what arrived live while this page was open (public/js/live.js shows it and counts; Show reloads
      the page as it stands, query and all). Inbox cards never slide in by themselves: you may be reading or typing a
      reply (docs/LIVE.md). (Likes do, in the Likes page's default view; this pill is for its other
      views.) Hidden until something arrives; without script it never shows.
      Params: `text` (what the pill says after the count, or alone with a conversation), and either `list` ("inbox" or
      "likes": a list page's pill, counting every reply or mention / every like on your posts) or `conversation` (a
      conversation's: only posts in it, no count). --}}
<div class="live-pill-row">
  <button type="button" class="live-pill" data-live-pill{{#if conversation}} data-live-conversation="{{conversation}}"{{else}} data-live-list="{{list}}"{{/if}} data-text="{{text}}" hidden>{{text}} · Show</button>
</div>
